This software is designed to be built against NASA's core Flight System
(cFS), https://github.com/nasa/cFS, which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and is not included in this repository.

The five NASA cFS support applications this software depends on (DS, FM,
HS, LC and SC, from https://github.com/nasa/DS and siblings) are
referenced as git submodules under vendor/cfs-support-apps/ and are
not modified in this repository. They carry NASA's own Apache License,
Version 2.0 notices.

install.sh modifies the following NASA cFS files in the user's cFS tree
when it runs (it does not ship copies of them): the TO_LAB subscription
table, the SCH_LAB schedule table, the cFE startup script, the OSAL
configuration, and the LC and SC configuration headers. Those
modifications are described in the script and are made under the same
Apache License, Version 2.0.

